# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env.agents — audierne2026
# Concern: per-agent forge seats (<AGENT>_FORGE_TOKEN), so the realm's forge
# tools (forge-read.sh, forge-write.sh) run from inside this checkout against
# the tracker named in .zeitgit-context. Blast radius: agent credential rotation.
#
# The names are NOT listed here: they come from the skill registry's census
# (catalog.forge_token_var) and change with it. To see which seats this
# project needs and whether each one authenticates (non-disclosing):
#   bash ~/.claude/skills/forsethi/scripts/check_agent_tokens.sh --probe
#
# Not loaded by scripts/dev-env.sh: the forge tools load it themselves.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
